  "content": "<p style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff\">欢迎来到 SlashBladeCraftTweaker 维基！</p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff\">这是一个用于自定义 SlashBlade 的 CraftTweaker 扩展模块，<span style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff;display:inline !important;float:none\">您可以注册自定义的 SlashBlade ItemStack 和 AwakeBladeRecipe（开发中），并且还可以获取其他刀片（开发中）。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff;display:inline !important;float:none\"><span style=\"display:inline !important;float:none;background-color:#ffffff;color:#19171c;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:600;line-height:inherit;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">重要说明：</span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>仍在开发中，<span style=\"font-family:arial black,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-align:left;color:#f00;text-transform:none;line-height:inherit;text-indent:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:underline;display:inline !important;float:none;background-color:#ffffff\">请自行承担使用风险。</span></strong></span></strong></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要 Forge <span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">1.12.2 - 14.23.5.2768</span>。</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"display:inline !important;float:none;background-color:#ffffff;color:#19171c;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">欢迎加入 MMF Group Discord：</span><a style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#6441a4;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:border:0px solid #a49fad\" href=\"https://discord.gg/qWebbVh\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/qWebbVh</a></p>",
